#line 1 "MOVEALN.cbl"
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. MOVEALN.


 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 X5 PIC X(5).
 01 X10 PIC X(10) VALUE "ABCDEFGHIJ".
 01 J5 PIC X(5) JUSTIFIED RIGHT.
 01 J5V PIC X(5) JUSTIFIED RIGHT VALUE "AB".
 01 A3 PIC A(3).
 01 GRP.
 05 GA PIC X(2).
 05 GN PIC 9(3).
 05 GB PIC X(2).
 01 SMALL PIC X(3) VALUE "XYZ".
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
 MOVE "AB" TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE X10 TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE X10 TO J5
 DISPLAY "[" J5 "]" 
 MOVE "AB" TO J5
 DISPLAY "[" J5 "] [" J5V "]" 
 MOVE "ABCDEF" TO A3
 DISPLAY "[" A3 "]" 
 MOVE SMALL TO GRP
 DISPLAY "[" GRP "]" 
 MOVE X10 TO GRP
 DISPLAY "[" GRP "] [" GN "]" 
 MOVE SPACES TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE ZERO TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE ALL "AB" TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE ALL "-" TO X10
 DISPLAY "[" X10 "]" 
 MOVE QUOTE TO X5
 DISPLAY "[" X5 "]" 
 MOVE ALL "XY" TO GRP
 DISPLAY "[" GRP "]" 
 MOVE GRP TO SMALL
 DISPLAY "[" SMALL "]" 
 MOVE "12345" TO X5
 MOVE X5 TO J5
 DISPLAY "[" J5 "]" 
 STOP RUN.
